# Youth Solutions — Saturday Classes
## Live Website & Business Pitch

**Client:** Youth Solutions (Andisa Simelane)
**Business:** Saturday tutoring classes for Grades 10–12 at the University of the Western Cape Great Hall, 8:00 AM – 12:00 PM. Subjects: Mathematics, Maths Literacy, Physical Sciences, Life Sciences, Accounting, Geography. Tutors are top-performing UWC students.

**Live demo:** https://saturday-bright-learners.lovable.app

---

## The problem
Youth Solutions currently reaches learners through flyers and WhatsApp. That means:
- Parents have no single trusted place to verify the programme, see subjects, or check the venue.
- Andisa manually chases every enquiry over WhatsApp — enquiries get lost, no follow-up history, no way to see conversion rates.
- No way to prove credibility to schools, sponsors, or parents outside the immediate network.

## The solution I built
A professional single-domain web presence **plus** a private Mini-CRM to manage every enquiry end-to-end.

### 1. Public marketing site
- Hero with the Youth Solutions brand, tagline, and clear call-to-action.
- Subjects, grades, venue (UWC Great Hall), and Saturday 8–12 schedule visible above the fold.
- "Excellent UWC students as tutors" positioned as the credibility hook.
- Enrolment form captures: learner name, parent contact, grade, subject(s), and message.
- Mobile-first — most parents in the target market browse on phones.

### 2. Private Mini-CRM (`/admin`)
- Every form submission lands as a **lead** in a secure database.
- Dashboard KPIs: total leads, new this week, contacted, converted.
- Search + filter by status, grade, and subject.
- Lead pipeline: **New → Contacted → Converted / Lost**.
- Internal notes on each lead so Andisa (and future team members) never lose context.
- First admin is created via the sign-up flow; further access is role-gated.

## How this grows the business
| Before | After |
|---|---|
| Flyer + WhatsApp only | Shareable URL for every flyer, WhatsApp status, and school visit |
| Enquiries lost in chats | 100% of enquiries captured in the CRM |
| No follow-up discipline | Status pipeline + notes prompt follow-up |
| No credibility signal | Professional site legitimises Youth Solutions to parents and sponsors |
| No data | Weekly view of leads → conversions to guide marketing spend |

## Tech stack (for the deliverable)
- **Frontend:** React 19 + TanStack Start + Tailwind v4
- **Backend / DB / Auth:** Lovable Cloud (Postgres + Row Level Security + Auth)
- **Hosting:** Lovable (auto SSL, CDN)

